            <ArticleTitle>Surgical procedures for the relief of acute and chronic pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>701-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText Label="OBJECTIVE" NlmCategory="OBJECTIVE">To review current surgical procedures for the relief of acute and chronic pain.</AbstractText>
                <AbstractText Label="CONCLUSIONS" NlmCategory="CONCLUSIONS">Recent advances in knowledge of pain transmission and pain modulation have resulted in a more conservative approach to surgical intervention for the relief of pain. Those techniques which are contemporarily accepted as efficacious are outlined.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
